    "briefing": "Hey there,\n\nIf you're fitted for refueling, you might like this one. \n\nA beacon has just gone live at [Location], from a client whose [Ship] is in need of [FuelType], so make sure your pods are topped off.\n\nThe client vessel will pay you at the rate of [RefuelRequest], and as a United Wayfarers Club contractor, you will also qualify for the UWC service fee listed above upon completion.\n\nLooks like a zero-drama one and done, but it never hurts to keep your scanners live.\nLet me know if you're interested and let's get these good people on their way.\n\nWaiting to hear from you,\n\nDina Deloit\nDispatch Hub\nUnited Wayfarers Club\n\"We’ve got your back\"",
